{"at":"2026-02-26T23:07:42.613Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":1590,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/credits/how-referrals-work/","title":"How referrals work","description":"Refer estate agents to PropertyList and earn credits when they join and become active. Both agents benefit with rewards redeemable on all paid features.","body":"<p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"></p><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"></p><h1>How to Use the PropertyList Referral Program (Step-by-Step Guide)</h1><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Our Referral Program is designed to be simple, transparent, and rewarding for everyone involved.</span><p></p><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#0b1220\"><br></span></p><h2>🚀 Step 1: Copy Your Unique Referral Link</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Inside your dashboard, you’ll find your&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">personal referral link</strong><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">👉&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://agents.propertylist.es/referrals\" style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">or click here</a><br>💬 Step 2: Share With the Right Agents<br><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">For best results, send a short personal message explaining why you think PropertyList will benefit them.</span><br><h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">✅</span> Step 3: Approval &amp; Tracking</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Once the referred agent registers, our admin team reviews and approves their account.</span><br><h2>🎁 Step 4: Get Rewarded (Win-Win)</h2><span style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">When your referred agent is approved:</span><p></p><p></p><h2><p data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"138\" style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">Grow your network. Help other agents succeed. Get rewarded for it.</p></h2><h2><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">This link is unique to you and automatically tracks every agent who signs up through it - so you always get full credit for your referrals.</p><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">👉<strong>&nbsp;Copy the link</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>share it directly with agents</strong>&nbsp;you know via WhatsApp, email, LinkedIn or even on your social media.</p><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\"></p></h2><h2><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">People respond best to:</p><ul style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\"><li><p>Personal recommendations</p></li><li><p>Clear benefits</p></li><li><p>Simple next steps</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">When they sign up using your link, the system automatically records them under your name.</p><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\"></p></h2><h2></h2><h2><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">As soon as they are approved:</p><ul style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\"><li><p>You’ll see them appear in your&nbsp;<strong>Referral Dashboard</strong></p></li><li><p>You can track all your referrals in one place</p></li><li><p>Everything is fully transparent</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">No guessing. No manual reporting. The system handles it for you.</p><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\"><br></p></h2><h2><ul style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\"><li><p><strong>You receive 20 credits</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>They receive 20 credits</strong></p></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">Both of you can use these credits toward featuring listings, ai tools, and all paid platform features.</p><p style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">You help another agent grow their business - and you both benefit immediately.</p></h2><p></p>","seo_title":"How referrals work - PropertyList.es Info Hub","seo_description":"Invite an agent to join PropertyList and you both earn credits when they become active. Use your credits for featuring your listings, ai tools, and more."}}